<title>JAPAN: Apic Yamada - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Apic Yamada - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.50		vs	   11.27</p>
<p> Operating	    1.23		vs	    1.07</p>
<p> Current		1.27		vs	    1.09</p>
<p> Net		  636    million    vs	  600    million</p>
<p> EPS		   49.08 yen	  vs	   61.34 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     13 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 10.00 yen	  vs	    7.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Apic Yamada Corp is a leading manufacturer of semiconductor leadframes.</p>
</text>
